THIRD-PARTY MAP DATA — NOT COVERED BY THE MIT LICENSE ABOVE

The code in this repository is MIT licensed. The generated map assets under
`src/assets/areas/` are derived from third-party sources, each under its own
license. Redistribution of those assets is governed by the source license, not
by this file:

  * Aerial imagery  — Esri World Imagery.
                      Source, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics, and the GIS User
                      Community. Subject to the Esri terms of use.
  * Topographic map — OpenTopoMap (https://opentopomap.org),
                      map data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
                      style CC-BY-SA 3.0.  *** SHARE-ALIKE ***
  * Elevation model — AWS Terrain Tiles (Terrarium), derived from public
                      sources including SRTM, NED, and NRCAN. Public domain to
                      CC-BY depending on the underlying source.

*** The OpenTopoMap layer is CC-BY-SA — a share-alike license. Before shipping
this component inside a closed or internal course, confirm that share-alike is
acceptable, or re-render the map layer from a source whose license fits. The
switch costs one URL change in `tools/fetch-topo.mjs` plus a regeneration run;
see the licensing note in ROADMAP.md.
